Hi John,

You can extract them very easily from the sdreport().
e.g. if the result of MakADFun() is "obj", then:

sdr <- sdreport(obj)
summary(sdr,select="random")

will give you the best estimates for the random effects plus their std. errors.

Cheers,
Gavin

